; case: interface-units-and-ranges
; verdict: accept
; ambiguous: no
; tests: externality=pass implementation-independence=pass non-prescription=pass
; rationale: Declares the representation contract at the architectural interface: what the
;   numbers mean and which values are admissible.
; other-side: engine: scaling, rounding implementation, conversion helpers, overflow checks
;
(defblock timer.counter
  (offers
    (tick-unit ns)
    (frequency (range 1 MHz 200 MHz))))
